@startuml
title Saga (choreography) — успешный сценарий

participant Mobile
participant API
participant OrderService
participant Kafka
participant InventoryService as Inventory
participant PaymentService as Payment
participant ShippingService as Shipping
participant NotificationService as Notification

== Сценарий A: успешное оформление заказа ==
Mobile -> API : Checkout(payload)
API -> OrderService : CreateOrder(payload)
OrderService -> Kafka : OrderCreated

Kafka -> Inventory : OrderCreated
Inventory -> Inventory : check stock & reserve
Inventory -> Kafka : InventoryReserved { order_id, reservation_id }

Kafka -> OrderService : InventoryReserved
OrderService -> Kafka : PaymentInitiated { order_id, amount }

Kafka -> Payment : PaymentInitiated
Payment -> Payment : external payment service
Payment -> Kafka : PaymentSucceeded { order_id, transaction_id }

Kafka -> OrderService : PaymentSucceeded
OrderService -> Kafka : OrderConfirmed { order_id }

Kafka -> Shipping : ShipmentRequested { order_id }
Shipping -> Shipping : create tracking / logistics request
Shipping -> Kafka : ShipmentCreated { order_id, tracking_id }

Kafka -> Notification : OrderConfirmed / ShipmentCreated
Notification -> Kafka : NotificationSent { order_id }

Mobile -> API : GetOrderStatus(order_id)
API -> OrderService : QueryOrder(order_id)
OrderService -> API : OrderStatus (CONFIRMED + SHIPPING)
API -> Mobile : OrderStatus

note right: Заказ оформлен, оплачен и передан в доставку.

@enduml
